           the edit buffer.  Ignore any argument.  Can be used as a movement
           command after vvii__cchhaannggee__mmeettaa, vvii__ddeelleettee__mmeettaa, or vvii__yyaannkk.

     eedd--mmoovvee--ttoo--eenndd (vi command: $, Ctrl-E; emacs: Ctrl-E)
           Move the cursor to the end of the edit buffer.  Ignore any argu‐
